      <div class="cell small-12 medium-8 large-8">
        <h2>NIH T32 Resources</h2>
      <p>Applicants should use the current NIH Notice of Funding Opportunity and NIH application instructions as the authoritative sources for requirements. The following links are provided for convenience:</p>
<div class="arrow">
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://grants.nih.gov/grants/guide/pa-files/PA-25-168.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Parent T32 Notice of Funding Opportunity (PA-25-168)</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://grants.nih.gov/grants-process/write-application/forms-directory/data-tables" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NIH Training Data Tables, Instructions, and Samples</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sciencv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SciENcv</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://grants.nih.gov/policy-and-compliance/policy-topics/nih-fiscal-policies/stipends-summary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NIH NRSA Stipend Levels and Fiscal Policy Summary</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://grants.nih.gov/policy-and-compliance/policy-topics/research-integrity/rcr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NIH Responsible Conduct of Research Resources</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://grants.nih.gov/policy-and-compliance/policy-topics/reproducibility" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NIH Rigor and Reproducibility Resources</a></li>
  </ul>
</div>
      <p>Not all NIH institutes and centers participate in the Parent T32 announcement, and participating institutes may have institute-specific requirements, research priorities, deadlines, or funding opportunities. Applicants should review the current announcement and consult the appropriate NIH program contact before preparing an application.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

