        <h3 class="h5">Important Notice</h3>
      <p>NIH requirements, forms, policies, and funding levels may change. Applicants should consult the current Notice of Funding Opportunity and NIH application instructions for authoritative requirements. GSBS resources are intended to supplement, not replace, NIH guidance. Applicants are responsible for the accuracy, completeness, and timely submission of their applications.</p>
